依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin053-volume-lue-father","subject_person_id":"jgg_ap1_586","object_person_id":"x66_w2u_srq","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"泰息略"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-053","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu","source_id":"s-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu-ws2595666","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu:p002","quote":"時望氣者言廣陵有天子氣，故封為廣陵王，邑五萬戶。以劉寔為師，孟珩為友，楊准、馮蓀為文學。惠帝即位，立為皇太子。盛選德望以為師傅，以何劭為太師，王戎為太傅，楊濟為太保，裴楷為少師，張華為少傅，和嶠為少保。元康元年，出就東宮，又詔曰：「遹尚幼蒙，今出東宮，惟當賴師傅群賢之訓。其遊處左右，宜得正人使共周旋，能相長益者。」於是使太保衛瓘息庭、司空泰息略、太子太傅楊濟息毖、太子少師裴楷息憲、太子少傅張華息禕、尚書令華暠息恆與太子游處，以相輔導焉。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu:p002:m0172","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu:p002:m0170"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本段「息」繫各自具名父子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu:p002:m0170","start":170,"end":171,"surface":"泰","kind":"person","person_id":"x66_w2u_srq","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin053-volume-lue-father","subject_person_id":"jgg_ap1_586","object_person_id":"x66_w2u_srq","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"泰息略"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-053","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu","source_id":"s-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu-ws2595666","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu:p002","quote":"時望氣者言廣陵有天子氣，故封為廣陵王，邑五萬戶。以劉寔為師，孟珩為友，楊准、馮蓀為文學。惠帝即位，立為皇太子。盛選德望以為師傅，以何劭為太師，王戎為